(expr) desugaring: a plain arithmetic expression
7
[...] desugaring: a plain list literal
[1, 2, 3]
nested (expr) inside [...]: each element is its own expression
[2, 6, 10]
list $integer
interaction between the two: a list literal nested inside another
[[1, 2], [3, 4]]
list $(list $integer)
a list literal element can be a full command substitution, not just a literal
[3, 99]
empty [] errors rather than producing an empty list
